    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_724_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_1020_reed2_1#1$1",
        "fadetime": 0.7,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_724_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_1020_reed2_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You want to bring that lot with you? Don't even think about it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Selmon"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you'll wait until they rest, if you'll share your own food with them, that I can accept.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Selmon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_724_1#9$1",
        "name2": "avg_1020_reed2_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "But we've avoided the patrol out of pure luck the last two days. What if we don't the next time? Those kids must be seven or eight. Can't fight back with weapons, can't run fast enough. What do you do about that?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Selmon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_724_1#9$1",
        "name2": "avg_1020_reed2_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I can fight... I'll protect them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reed"
    },
    {
        "text": "You want to cross through the uninhabited region, to completely escape Trent's jurisdiction. I can aid you, the whole way.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reed"
    },
    {
        "text": "I contacted the organization I belong to, with the help of Bagpipe and Ch'en... my colleagues. I've confirmed the closest safehouse\u2014is just along this way.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reed"
    },
    {
        "text": "If all we need is some tents, and a small amount of emergency supplies for the countryside, they can transport it over without a problem.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reed"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_724_1#9$1",
        "name2": "avg_1020_reed2_1#9$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "And I know, the territory over there... belongs to a well-hearted Duke. Once we're there, the army won't be after you anymore, at the very least.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reed"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_724_1#9$1",
        "name2": "avg_1020_reed2_1#9$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Really? There's an honest-to-God noble who'd smile on people like us?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Selmon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_724_1#9$1",
        "name2": "avg_1020_reed2_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "He has... reason to shelter the Tarans.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reed"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_724_1#9$1",
        "name2": "avg_1020_reed2_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "And how do you know?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Selmon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_724_1#9$1",
        "name2": "avg_1020_reed2_1#8$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...Before long, perhaps we'll all know.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reed"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_724_1#9$1",
        "name2": "avg_1020_reed2_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "We'll have ways to survive, bringing those people along.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reed"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_243"
    },
    {
        "text": "But. Don't forget. They're Infected.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Overwrought Taran Refugee"
    },
    {
        "text": "We've constantly been scarpering with our lives. What are we doing inviting death to our sides?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Overwrought Taran Refugee"
    },
    {
        "text": "And we don't know when the sick'll have their flare-ups. Or when they'll just kick the bucket outright...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Overwrought Taran Refugee"
    },
    {
        "text": "What's the point in you saving these sorts of people?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Overwrought Taran Refugee"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#12$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reed"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#13$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't know.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reed"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#12$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I only know, that when someone saved me... I wanted to ask her the same. Why?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reed"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even though I was... so close to death.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reed"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_243"
    },
    {
        "text": "What are you getting at?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Overwrought Taran Refugee"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm an Infected too.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reed"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_724_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Selmon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_243"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wha? Oh. Er...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Overwrought Taran Refugee"
    },
    {
        "text": "*cough*. Alright. Doesn't mean much to be Infected. Wouldn't have lived much longer than Infected ourselves without your help anyway. Haha.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Overwrought Taran Refugee"
    },
    {
        "text": "Still...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Overwrought Taran Refugee"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oripathy won't spread just because we're in the same place.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reed"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's okay. You can keep a bit of distance, if you're scared. I don't mind.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reed"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "But take those Infected with you on your escape... Trust me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reed"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_243"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Fine. I trust you! Selmon. You heard what she said...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Overwrought Taran Refugee"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_724_1#10$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014I'm not fleeing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Selmon"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you're gonna take the ones that can't fight, take 'em. Suit your own self.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Selmon"
    },
    {
        "text": "But my aim isn't gonna change one bit. I'm returning to Dublinn.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Selmon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
