    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_241",
        "name2": "avg_npc_248",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...These two units have gone unaccounted for a week by now. We may surmise these circumstances relate to Dublinn, being similar to past spectre force incidents.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Solemn Officer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_241",
        "name2": "avg_npc_248",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Similar? No, the situation we're looking at now is completely unalike.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Biting Officer"
    },
    {
        "text": "These rebels previously would muster a single armed force to surface somewhere, launch an attack, and that was it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Biting Officer"
    },
    {
        "text": "Now, violence which we suspect to be Dublinn-incited is blanketing every corner of southern Victoria.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Biting Officer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_241",
        "name2": "avg_npc_248",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...Is the Marquess of Trent sticking fast to his orders?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Solemn Officer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_241",
        "name2": "avg_npc_248",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Obviously. No matter the volume of suspicious circumstances reported outside nomadic cities, we must have CLARITY on them. Get this entire region's state of affairs under control.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Biting Officer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_241",
        "name2": "avg_npc_248",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "But of all the small-scale conflicts, only the arson at Redridge seems truly suspect, and there was no follow-up on the fire there either.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Solemn Officer"
    },
    {
        "text": "Maybe we should set these particular dossiers aside for now? Or should we leave them?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Solemn Officer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4017_puzzle_1#1$1",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Please lend said dossiers to me, officers.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fischer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_241"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're... j...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Solemn Officer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4017_puzzle_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "And refrain with the greetings.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fischer"
    },
    {
        "text": "Also, just as before, no need to make a record of access to these dossiers.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fischer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4017_puzzle_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "This arson... may be worth a deeper investigation.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fischer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
