    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$m_dia_street_intro",
        "key": "$m_dia_street_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_725_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Have a sip of water, ould Breand\u00e1n. I picked some berries too. This place can't be too far from a settlement, what with a grove this thick.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fionn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_725_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You want some berries too, Holly? Alright, you eat those, and then you walk on your own two legs this afternoon. Won't need anyone else carrying you, okay?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fionn"
    },
    {
        "text": "How about you, Moran? Wait, you don't eat stuff this sweet, do you...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fionn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_728_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Thank you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moran"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_725_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...*sigh*.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fionn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_242",
        "name2": "avg_npc_725_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, how long are we stopping here for?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tempersome Taran Refugee"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_242",
        "name2": "avg_npc_725_1#8$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "While Bagpipe and Ch'en are fetching things for us. We're all knackered as is, anyhow. Got a chance to catch our breaths.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fionn"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't worry, I guarantee we'll find the closest village before lights-out.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fionn"
    },
    {
        "text": "We're far enough from all the trouble we made anyhow. If we hang around here and hole up for a few days, we oughtn't get caught.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fionn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_242",
        "name2": "avg_npc_725_1#8$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Fine, pick me some berries too. First time seeing you happy in days.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tempersome Taran Refugee"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_242",
        "name2": "avg_npc_725_1#8$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Er, really? I've just been glad Reed's so reliable, and her two friends too. Kind souls, plus they can fight.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fionn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_242",
        "name2": "avg_npc_725_1#8$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You sure? It's not just how your days of suffering are almost at an end?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tempersome Taran Refugee"
    },
    {
        "text": "We're going to keep pushing into the wastes, find Dublinn and join them. You, though, I bet you'd prefer to stay behind in village life.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tempersome Taran Refugee"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_242",
        "name2": "avg_npc_725_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...Er, I can't say that for sure.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fionn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_242",
        "name2": "avg_npc_725_1#6$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I... *sigh* I just can't get over you lot doing things this way.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fionn"
    },
    {
        "text": "We were all happy just with escaping at first, the further the better. That was before we ran into Selmon.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fionn"
    },
    {
        "text": "She only got to persuade you all to join Dublinn once stuff got tougher on us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fionn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_242",
        "name2": "avg_npc_725_1#5$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "None of you've... even seen a real Dublinn army, have you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fionn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
