        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_662_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_222_bpipe_1#7",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_662_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_222_bpipe_1#7",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you still thinking about Reed?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "She contacted Rhodes Island in full view of us after borrowing our comms equipment. Getting supplies has been smooth too. All signs indicate she's not out to trick us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_662_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_222_bpipe_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Haha, I'm not suspectin' her as much, I'm just a little concerned... Did she really make a recovery?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "text": "Granted, she's a Vouivre, but I'm still a little surprised at all the life in her... She gave my hands a right shock swingin' at me before we recognized each other.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "text": "Suppose that's a good thing, though. Just, I can't shake the feelin' there's weight on her mind. Whatever it is, she wants to do it, but it seems to hurt her so much.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_662_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_222_bpipe_1#7",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Plus...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_662_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_222_bpipe_1#7",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Plus what?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_662_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_222_bpipe_1#7",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "The way she fights just seems somehow familiar.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "text": "Did I meet her, even before Outcast brought her in, back at County Hillock?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_shallowswalk",
        "volume": 0.7,
        "loop": true,
        "channel": "walksp"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#6$1",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopsound",
        "channel": "walksp",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reed"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#8"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, aye, there you are, Reed! Perfect, me and Chenchen've been talkin'...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_662_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...We're talking about which way we're heading. This route happens to take us to a nearby settlement.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, we can't\u2014keep going in this direction... I'll tell the others\u2014to stop.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reed"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you sayin'...",
        "tag": "multiline",
        "name": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "xstrength": 15,
        "ystrength": 15,
        "vibrato": 20,
        "randomness": 70,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Chenchen, on your nine!",
        "tag": "multiline",
        "name": "Bagpipe",
        "end": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.2
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$e_skill_skulsrsword",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_metallicclick",
        "volume": 1,
        "delay": 0.1
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "effect",
        "name": "$e_slash_02_l",
        "x": -100,
        "y": 80,
        "rox": -10,
        "roy": 80,
        "roz": 90,
        "layer": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 255,
        "g": 255,
        "b": 255,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 255,
        "g": 255,
        "b": 255,
        "fadetime": 0.03,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 255,
        "g": 255,
        "b": 255,
        "fadetime": 0.3,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.2
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_metalcollar",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_metalcollar",
        "volume": 0.2,
        "loop": false,
        "channel": "cutdown",
        "delay": 0.2
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_662_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "The cavalry saber concealed in the bushes snaps in two."
    },
    {
        "text": "The one holding it doesn't shift an inch. Ch'en is sure her slash didn't harm anyone, but out from under the bush is still a hint of spilled blood. Blood deep and dark, old and dry."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$suspenseful_intro",
        "key": "$suspenseful_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is this... dead patrol?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, they're from the barracks. There's more over there.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_662_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "Traces of bolts, sabers... and Arts.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_662_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "This battle probably happened a week ago. This barracks unit was ambushed, and slaughtered to a man.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Who was the enemy, then? How come they didn't leave a single corpse behind?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "They've... left.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reed"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "They've all left? But with a battle this fierce, both sides should've taken equal damages, right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_662_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Bagpipe, remember the group of soldiers we discovered before encountering Reed?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mm... they had uncanny Arts planted in them, eyes full of fire...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "text": "Reed, you were in County Hillock too. Didn't you see soldiers like that?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Yes, I know of them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reed"
    },
    {
        "text": "They're... parted souls.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reed"
    },
    {
        "text": "Those with the misfortune of being deceased, yet unable to rest...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reed"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're not sayin'\u2014the ones who killed these soldiers are dead themselves, and they're still marchin' even after?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "text": "The traces of firefights we were chasin' before, it resembles those too.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_662_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...It's the only possibility.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Chenchen, I don't know what your thoughts are, but I... I can't quite accept it, if that's what this is.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "text": "What kind of person would\u2014keep on controllin' them, even after they're dead? That's just far too cruel.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reed"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_hidehaystack"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_724_1#10$1",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Selmon?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reed"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_724_1#10$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Like hell they're dead. You're all howling up the wrong tree.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Selmon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "But we saw, with our own eyes...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_724_1#10$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You saw something somewhere else. I only believe what I see myself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Selmon"
    },
    {
        "text": "Dublinn defeated a Victorian unit. They won, moved onto the next place, and now they're prepping to save more Tarans.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Selmon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_724_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You know I'm gonna...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Selmon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Are you worried about something?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reed"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_724_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't act like my da.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Selmon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_724_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "If Fionn's lot want to go with you, suit their own selves, but I know you're not in with us. It's those two Vouivre you're with.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Selmon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_724_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You just want to settle us someplace, ensure we're not going to die today. You'll make us live the same old life Victoria had for us, not knowing if we'll see tomorrow.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Selmon"
    },
    {
        "text": "And after that, you'll abandon us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Selmon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#11$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reed"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_724_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Am I not right, 'Leader'?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Selmon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "No. No, don't call me that...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reed"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_724_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Right. 'No.' Single word I've heard most from you so far.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Selmon"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm heading off now, going the way you didn't want us to go. It's only war and death, isn't it? Like the Tarans haven't seen plenty of both?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Selmon"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't want to hear an outsider tell me 'no' ever again.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Selmon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_shallowswalk",
        "volume": 0.7,
        "loop": true,
        "channel": "walksp1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopsound",
        "channel": "walksp1",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "I know she's fumin', but truth is, it's not you who's pissin' her off.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I know.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reed"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "So, are you... um, are you alright?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I want to go with her.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reed"
    },
    {
        "text": "There might still be... unexploded mines, and lingering Arts, left on the battlefield. It'll be dangerous to keep\u2014going that way.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reed"
    },
    {
        "text": "Can you call the rest over for me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reed"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_662_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Didn't you want these Tarans to steer clear of the battlefield?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mm.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reed"
    },
    {
        "text": "But\u2014Selmon says, it's their choice.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reed"
    },
    {
        "text": "And I... I promised, I'd escort them, until...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reed"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1020_reed2_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reed"
    },
    {
        "text": "Until I'm no longer needed.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reed"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
